<title>FINLAND: OUTOKUMPU 8-MTH PROFIT FALLS 92 PCT.</title>
<headline>OUTOKUMPU 8-MTH PROFIT FALLS 92 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight months to August 31-</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p>Profit before extraordinary items, tax  109 vs 1,320</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		0.28 vs 7.54</p>
<p> Net sales				    11,077 vs 11,148</p>
<p> Operating profit				331 vs 1,357</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' median forecast profit before</p>
<p>extraordinaries and tax was 237 million markka (mean 242 mln) in</p>
<p>a 110-389 million markka range.</p>
<p> Depreciation				  586 vs 527</p>
<p>Share in results of</p>
<p> associated companies		charge 97 vs 8 charge</p>
<p> Net financial items		charge 125 vs 29 charge</p>
<p> Extraordinary items			 nil vs 58 charge</p>
<p> Taxes					    71 vs 380</p>
<p> Minorities			     charge 3 vs 1 charge</p>
<p> Net profit				     35 vs 881</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)     43.2 vs 43.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish mining and metals group is</p>
<p>Outokumpu Oy.</p>
